      "id": "RULE_INTEGER_OVERFLOW_140_32f16fc396",
      "function": "_executor_handle_network_request",
      "location": "src/executor.c:140",
      "category": "integer_overflow",
      "subcategory": "integer_overflow",
      "description": "Allocation size is computed inline with unchecked addition/multiplication.",
      "root_cause": "The allocation expression can wrap before the allocator sees it.",
      "suggested_fix": "Validate operands before the allocation expression or use checked arithmetic.",
      "confidence": 0.84,
      "impact_level": "medium",
      "reasoning": "确定性规则 `inline_allocation_size_overflow` 在 `_executor_handle_network_request` 的 `src/executor.c:140` 命中了 `integer_overflow`（CWE-190） 候选。\n问题判断：Allocation size is computed inline with unchecked addition/multiplication.\n数据/资源路径：源/对象 `task->payload.binary.size * 2` -> 汇点/操作 `void* response_buffer = _safe_malloc(task->payload.binary.size * 2);`。\n保护状态：当前函数内未看到足够的边界检查、所有权转移或同步保护。\n关键证据：\n- line 140: allocator call contains arithmetic `task->payload.binary.size * 2`\n- `_safe_malloc` classified as allocator API via name_heuristic\n反向证据：未发现能否定该候选的本地保护或清理证据。\n根因：The allocation expression can wrap before the allocator sees it.\n建议：Validate operands before the allocation expression or use checked arithmetic.",
      "code_snippet": "135 |     if (!task) {\n136 |         return -1;\n137 |     }\n138 |     \n139 |     if (task->payload.binary.data && task->payload.binary.size > 0) {\n140 |         void* response_buffer = _safe_malloc(task->payload.binary.size * 2);\n141 |         if (response_buffer) {\n142 |             memcpy(response_buffer, task->payload.binary.data, \n143 |                    task->payload.binary.size);\n144 |             free(response_buffer);\n145 |         }\n146 |     }\n147 |     ",
      "validation_status": "validated",
