        "subcategory": "deadlock",
        "description": "`_plugin_unregister` calls `_plugin_lookup` while `registry.mutex` is held; `_plugin_lookup` can acquire `registry.mutex` again.",
        "root_cause": "A helper with its own locking contract is reached under an already-held lock.",
        "suggested_fix": "Use a no-lock helper variant, document the caller-held lock contract, or release before calling.",
        "confidence": 0.95,
        "impact_level": "high",
        "reasoning": "Graph candidate generated from cross-function C protocol evidence.",
        "code_snippet": "94 |         return -1;\n95 |     }\n96 |     \n97 |     LOCK(&registry->mutex);\n98 |     \n99 |     Plugin* plugin = _plugin_lookup(registry, name);\n100 |     if (!plugin) {\n101 |         UNLOCK(&registry->mutex);\n102 |         return -1;\n103 |     }\n104 |     \n105 |     if (plugin->cleanup) {\n106 |         _plugin_call_cleanup(plugin);",
        "validation_status": "validated",
        "validation_reasoning": "已验证的死锁漏洞。`_plugin_unregister`在第97行获取`registry->mutex`后，在第99行调用`_plugin_lookup`，而`_plugin_lookup`在第71行尝试再次获取同一个`registry->mutex`。关键证据：`_plugin_registry_init`第25行使用`pthread_mutex_init(&registry->mutex, NULL)`初始化互斥锁，NULL参数意味着使用默认属性，即`PTHREAD_MUTEX_DEFAULT`类型的非递归互斥锁。当同一线程尝试对非递归互斥锁进行二次加锁时，会导致死锁或未定义行为。该漏洞可通过公共API `td_unregister_plugin`触发。",
        "finding_kind": "verified_vulnerability",
        "validator_verdict": "verified",
        "cwe": "CWE-833",
        "source": "公共API `td_unregister_plugin`的参数`plugin_name`，由调用者控制",
        "sink": "非递归互斥锁`registry->mutex`的同线程二次加锁操作",
        "guard_analysis": "无有效防护。互斥锁初始化时未指定`PTHREAD_MUTEX_RECURSIVE`属性，且`_plugin_lookup`函数内部没有检测调用者是否已持有锁的机制。锁类型为`pthread_mutex_t`，默认为非递归锁，同线程二次加锁必然导致死锁。",
        "exploit_scenario": "攻击者或调用者通过公共API `td_unregister_plugin(plugin_name)`传入任意插件名称，触发以下调用链：`td_unregister_plugin` → `_plugin_unregister`（获取registry->mutex）→ `_plugin_lookup`（尝试再次获取registry->mutex）。由于互斥锁是非递归类型，同一线程的二次加锁将导致死锁，线程永久阻塞。这是一个确定性的、可重复触发的死锁漏洞。",
        "positive_evidence": [
          "src/plugin.c:97 - `_plugin_unregister`调用`LOCK(&registry->mutex)`获取互斥锁",
