          "src/plugin.c:71 - `_plugin_lookup`调用`LOCK(&registry->mutex)`尝试获取同一个互斥锁",
          "src/plugin.c:25 - `pthread_mutex_init(&registry->mutex, NULL)`使用NULL属性初始化，创建非递归互斥锁",
          "src/utils.c:93 - `_lock_wrapper`直接调用`pthread_mutex_lock`，无递归锁处理",
