      "description": "Condition variable wait is guarded by `if` rather than a predicate loop.",
      "root_cause": "Spurious wakeups or missed predicate changes can make the thread continue incorrectly.",
      "suggested_fix": "Guard pthread_cond_wait with a while loop that rechecks the shared predicate.",
      "confidence": 0.83,
      "impact_level": "high",
      "reasoning": "确定性规则 `cond_wait_guarded_by_if` 在 `_lifecycle_wait_for_work` 的 `src/lifecycle.c:291` 命中了 `lost_wakeup`（CWE-366） 候选。\n问题判断：Condition variable wait is guarded by `if` rather than a predicate loop.\n数据/资源路径：源/对象 `condition predicate` -> 汇点/操作 `pthread_cond_wait(&g_lifecycle.cond, &g_lifecycle.lock);`。\n保护状态：当前函数内未看到足够的边界检查、所有权转移或同步保护。\n关键证据：\n- nearby branch uses `if` before pthread_cond_wait\n- line 291: condition variable wait\n反向证据：未发现能否定该候选的本地保护或清理证据。\n根因：Spurious wakeups or missed predicate changes can make the thread continue incorrectly.\n建议：Guard pthread_cond_wait with a while loop that rechecks the shared predicate.",
      "code_snippet": "288 | int _lifecycle_wait_for_work(void) {\n289 |     LOCK(&g_lifecycle.lock);\n290 |     if (g_lifecycle.pending_jobs == 0) {\n291 |         pthread_cond_wait(&g_lifecycle.cond, &g_lifecycle.lock);\n292 |     }\n293 | \n294 |     g_lifecycle.pending_jobs--;\n295 |     UNLOCK(&g_lifecycle.lock);\n296 |     return 0;\n297 | }",
