      "reasoning": "1. 函数在line 536执行`*cursor = session->next`从链表移除节点\n2. 移除后直接返回0，未调用SAFE_FREE或pthread_mutex_destroy\n3. 对比_control_session_drop_from_global(lines 515-517)正确释放所有资源\n4. 每次DETACH命令导致sizeof(ControlSession)+strlen(owner)+pthread_mutex_t资源的永久泄漏",
      "root_cause": "函数设计为'without_release'但无后续释放机制，孤立会话无法被回收",
      "suggested_fix": "在移除节点后添加资源释放代码：pthread_mutex_destroy(&session->guard); SAFE_FREE(session->owner); SAFE_FREE(session);",
