      "code_snippet": "LOCK(&g_lifecycle.lock);\njob.entry = g_lifecycle.entries;\nUNLOCK(&g_lifecycle.lock);\n...\n// In _flush_worker:\nif (job && job->entry && job->entry->value) {\n    LOG_INFO(\"flushing %s to %s\", job->entry->value, job->path);",
