        "src/lifecycle.c:251-253: job.entry = g_lifecycle.entries在锁保护下读取，但锁在传递给工作线程前已释放",
        "src/lifecycle.c:147-167: _lifecycle_remove_entry在锁保护下释放entry，工作线程无锁访问同一entry",
        "internal/lifecycle.ph:19: _lifecycle_schedule_flush声明为公共API，可被外部代码调用"
      ],
