      {
        "id": "ISSUE_1",
        "function": "_lifecycle_recv_packet",
        "location": "src/lifecycle.c:318",
        "category": "signed_unsigned",
        "subcategory": "buffer_overflow",
        "description": "当_net_recv_data返回-1（网络错误）时，(size_t)received转换为SIZE_MAX，导致memcpy复制极大数量字节，引发严重栈缓冲区溢出",
        "reasoning": "1. _net_recv_data在recv系统调用失败时返回-1\n2. 第318行将int类型的received强制转换为size_t：size_t copy_len = (size_t)received\n3. 当received=-1时，copy_len变为SIZE_MAX（约18EB或4GB，取决于平台）\n4. 第322行memcpy(dst, temp, copy_len)复制SIZE_MAX字节到dst缓冲区\n5. 调用者_packet_receiver_thread传入512字节栈缓冲区packet[512]，导致栈溢出\n6. 该漏洞可通过网络错误或恶意连接触发，属于IPC入口点的信任边界问题",
        "root_cause": "未在memcpy前检查received是否为-1（错误值），直接将int错误码转换为size_t导致极大值",
        "suggested_fix": "在第318行后添加错误检查：if (received < 0) { return -1; } 或在第322行前添加：if (copy_len == SIZE_MAX) { return -1; }",
        "confidence": 0.95,
        "impact_level": "critical",
        "code_snippet": "int received = _net_recv_data(fd, temp, sizeof(temp));\n    size_t copy_len = (size_t)received;",
        "normalized_category": "signed_unsigned",
        "dedup_key": "signed_unsigned|src/lifecycle.c|net_recv_data_negative_length",
        "duplicate_sources": [
